rom 6 males); calls occur at intervals ranging from 1.85 – 7.72 s (3.54 ± 1.19 s, n ¼ 36 intervals from 6 males); 20 – 45 notes per call (30 ± 6.67, n ¼ 36 calls from 6 males), given at a rate ranging from 14.8 – 18.3 / s (16.6 ± 1.02 / s, n ¼ 36 calls from 6 males); note duration ranges from 0.009 – 0.023 s (0.016 ± 0.002 s, n ¼ 108 notes of 36 calls from 6 males); notes given at intervals ranging from 0.036 – 0.058 s (0.45 ± 0.005 s, n ¼ 108 intervals of 36 calls from 6 males); each note consists of a rising frequency – modulated whistle; the dominant frequency occurs in the third harmonic and ranges from 3937.5 – 5062.5 Hz (4640.63 ± 28.47 Hz, n ¼ 36 call notes from 6 males); the first note may be lower, with a dominant frequency range of 3937.5 – 4687.5 Hz (4283.7 ± 18.01, n ¼ 36 call notes from 6 males).","","text","",""]]},"QBQJF":{"d":[["South West Atlantic","17810","mrgid","native",""]]},"QHD3D":{"d":[["Distribution. Australia: New South Wales, Northern Territory, Queensland, South Australia.","","text","",""]]},"QR5RJ":{"d":[["","TW","iso","native",""]]},"R48D2":{"d":[["Tanzania","","text","",""]]},"R9V3":{"d":[["","NWG","tdwg","",""]]},"RHWC":{"d":[["CHC-YN","CHC-YN","tdwg","",""]]},"RQ36H":{"d":[["Distribution. China (Yunnan).","","text","",""]]},"RV3FS":{"d":[["North America","","text","",""]]},"RV3G2":{"d":[["North America","","text","",""]]},"RX7S":{"d":[["Vietnamese Exclusive Economic Zone","8484","mrgid","",""]]},"RX82":{"d":[["Peruvian Exclusive Economic Zone","8432","mrgid","",""]]},"S35HQ":{"d":[["Africa","","text","",""],["Europe & Northern Asia (excluding China)","","text","",""]]},"S6Y2":{"d":[["Iran","","text","",""]]},"SDVQV":{"d":[["Distribution. South-western Central African Republic (Lobaye prefecture).","","text","",""]]},"SQBN":{"d":[["","NWG","tdwg","",""]]},"TYNY":{"d":[["North America","","text","",""]]},"V2LPP":{"d":[["Distribution. North Vietnam.","","text","",""]]},"V3QD6":{"d":[["China","","text","",""]]},"V5QX":{"d":[["Western Ca